WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.804
"Brakes?" cried Zippy.

2
00:00:08.805 --> 00:00:14.787
"Brakes are boring!"

3
00:00:14.788 --> 00:00:18.107
Eddy didn't like Zippy.

4
00:00:18.108 --> 00:00:20.901
But Zippy was right.

5
00:00:20.902 --> 00:00:24.128
Brakes were boring.

6
00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:28.820
"Brakes are very important," said Mr. Grill.

7
00:00:28.821 --> 00:00:34.212
"First we must check them."

8
00:00:34.213 --> 00:00:38.190
The teacher drove slowly.

9
00:00:38.191 --> 00:00:41.809
Then he stopped.

10
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.267
"See?" he said.

11
00:00:44.268 --> 00:00:46.677
"My brakes work.

12
00:00:46.678 --> 00:00:54.001
Now you all try."

13
00:00:54.002 --> 00:01:01.214
Most students checked their brakes.

14
00:01:01.215 --> 00:01:03.772
But Zippy didn't.

15
00:01:03.773 --> 00:01:07.460
"My brakes are fine," said Zippy.

16
00:01:07.461 --> 00:01:12.549
"I don't need to check them."

17
00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:28.255
Mr. Grill drove around the parking lot.

18
00:01:28.256 --> 00:01:35.308
"Use brakes when you turn," he said.

19
00:01:35.309 --> 00:01:38.080
Mr. Grill slowed down.

20
00:01:38.081 --> 00:01:39.882
He made a turn.

21
00:01:39.883 --> 00:01:44.012
Then he went faster.

22
00:01:44.013 --> 00:01:46.883
"Ugh," said Zippy.

23
00:01:46.884 --> 00:01:49.922
"Race cars never slow down."

24
00:01:49.923 --> 00:01:52.468
"Yeah!" said Eddy.

25
00:01:52.469 --> 00:01:57.861
"I won't check my brakes either."

